libstdc++ IRIX OS layer

Add the IRIX 5.2/6.5 locale and atomic support directories
(config/os/irix), including the ctype tables built on IRIX's _IS* masks
and test_then_add-based atomics, and wire them up in configure.host and
crossconfig.m4. Also route wcsftime's wchar_t format through the OS
declaration, disable the IRIX-unsupported C++17 floating-point to_chars
paths, skip the C99 compatibility wrappers for <complex.h>/<fenv.h> and
define _SGI_COMPILING_LIBC in c++config.

This layer is not exercised by the C-only acceptance build; it is kept
for the C++ deliverable and the native build.

Provenance: pdaxrom/irix-gcc tag 1.2 (2aa3421b), gcc-15.2.0-irix.diff and
gcc-15.2.0-irix65-stdc++.diff. libstdc++-v3/configure is the generated
file from the same series.

